msgid "Re-license the project through your own licensed ETS, which re-signs the copy with your dongle license:\n\nETS 6 - use the local project store below:\n   1. Click 'Export to ProjectStore'. It writes the project's 'P-XXXX' folder straight into your ETS 6 project store. If ETS is not installed on this computer, you are asked for the store folder (or any folder you then copy over manually).\n   2. The export needs your 'installer.guid' from C:\\ProgramData\\KNX\\ETS6\\Installer. If it cannot be found automatically, you are asked to select it.\n   3. Restart ETS 6 - the project appears in the project overview.\n   4. Make a copy of it there (Copy in the overview). The copy is re-signed with your license - open it, then use or export it normally.\n\nETS 5 - no project store is needed: go Back and choose 'Export without Certificate' (with ETS 5 as the file type) to save a .knxproj, then import that file into ETS 5. It opens unsigned and is re-licensed when you save it there.\n\nThis is bounded by the device-per-project limit of your license."
msgstr "Projekt znova licencirajte prek svojega licenciranega ETS, ki kopijo znova podpiše z vašo licenco na ključu dongle:\n\nETS 6 – uporabite spodnjo lokalno shrambo projektov:\n   1. Kliknite »Izvozi v ProjectStore«. Mapa projekta 'P-XXXX' se zapiše neposredno v shrambo projektov ETS 6. Če ETS v tem računalniku ni nameščen, boste vprašani za mapo shrambe (ali katero koli mapo, iz katere jo nato ročno kopirate).\n   2. Izvoz potrebuje vašo datoteko 'installer.guid' iz C:\\ProgramData\\KNX\\ETS6\\Installer. Če je ni mogoče najti samodejno, jo boste morali izbrati.\n   3. Znova zaženite ETS 6 – projekt se prikaže v pregledu projektov.\n   4. Tam naredite njegovo kopijo ('Copy' v pregledu). Kopija je znova podpisana z vašo licenco – odprite jo, nato jo uporabljajte ali izvozite kot običajno.\n\nETS 5 – shramba projektov ni potrebna: pojdite »Nazaj« in izberite »Izvozi brez potrdila« (z ETS 5 kot vrsto datoteke), da shranite .knxproj, nato to datoteko uvozite v ETS 5. Odpre se nepodpisana in se znova licencira, ko jo tam shranite.\n\nTo omejuje največje število naprav na projekt, ki ga dovoljuje vaša licenca."

